sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Vessel as Ocean Vessel (At Sea)
    participant eFTI as eFTI Exchange / Customs (EU 2020/1056)
    participant Portbase as Portbase Secure Chain
    participant TOS as Terminal TOS (Maasvlakte II)
    participant RFO as Rail Freight Operator (RFC NSRM)
    participant Quay as Quayside Rail Buffer

    Note over Vessel,RFO: T - 10 to T - 5 Days: Advance Data Crystallization
    Vessel->>eFTI: Transmit Consignment & Manifest Dataset (eFTI e-CMR/e-CIM)
    eFTI->>eFTI: Automated Customs Pre-Clearance & Risk Check
    eFTI->>Portbase: Issue Cryptographic Release Token
    Portbase->>TOS: Pre-Advise Inbound Container & Block Stowage
    Portbase->>RFO: Pre-Allocate Wagon Slot & Departure Train ID

    Note over TOS,RFO: T - 48 to T - 24 Hours: Resource Synchronization
    TOS->>Quay: Assign Direct-to-Rail Staging Line (Bypass Stacking Yard)
    RFO->>Quay: Stage Rolling Stock on Quayside Track

    Note over Vessel,Quay: T = 0: Berth & Discharge Execution
    Vessel->>Quay: STS Crane Discharges Container Directly to Rail Buffer
    Quay->>TOS: Validate Container ID against Pre-Cleared Token
    TOS->>Quay: Immediate Loading Clearance (0 Re-handles)
    Quay->>RFO: Train Built & Ready for Dispatch (Dwell: 4.4h vs 54.9h Baseline)
